// ============================================================

// CHANGELOG:
// v5.9.4: Fixed lingering duplicate listeners on recycled elements. When
//          loadstart detects a src change and re-inits, the OLD event listeners
//          (play, pause, seeked, etc.) were still attached. Fix: AbortController
//          groups all per-video listeners; ac.abort() mass-removes them on recycle
//          so trackVideo starts clean. No more duplicate played/paused/interacted.
// v5.9.3: Fixed duplicate statements (played x3, completed x2) caused by the
//          v5.9.2 loadstart listener firing on INITIAL load, not just recycling.
//          Fix: capture src at init time; only tear down + re-init when src
//          ACTUALLY CHANGES. Also gates the duration<1 retry with a flag so
//          only one of durationchange/loadedmetadata can trigger trackVideo.
// v5.9.2: Fixed video tracking stopping after 2 videos. Root cause: Storyline
//          recycles ≤2 <video> DOM elements across slides. Once xapiTracked was
//          set, recycled elements were never re-initialized. Fix adds loadstart
//          listener to detect src change and re-init with fresh closures/session.
//          Also fixes duration<1 dead-end: adds durationchange retry so videos
//          arriving with placeholder duration aren't permanently skipped.
// v5.9.1: Issue 4a ONLY - ignore Storyline's TINY_VIDEO placeholder (<1s) when
//          reading video length, so 0.046 can't stand in for the real duration.
//          Seek and completion handling are byte-for-byte the soft-launch v5.9.
//          The v5.10/v5.11 seek debounce and interaction gate are NOT included.
// v5.9: Added JS_ModuleVersion → context.revision field.
//        Added LessonTitleSetManually → LESSON_TITLE.
// v5.8: Fixed mobile CC/subtitle disable on ratechange.
//        Fixed mobile-only missing terminated statement (parallel send).
// v5.7: Fixed initialized not firing on revisit after browser close.
// v5.6: Terminated-on-close, fullscreen duplicate fix, player chrome.
// v5.5: Player chrome detection for mute/volume controls.
