        // ============================================================
        // AUTO VIDEO TRACKER — xAPI Video Profile Compliant
        // v5.9.4 FIX: AbortController removes ALL old listeners on recycle
        // v5.9.3 FIX: src comparison on loadstart + gated duration retry
