        " | 1.9 | Imagine you are Kai and it’s four weeks from launch. You used AI to generate code as part of your workflow, but review flags appeared. What's your next move?";
    //                                                  ▲▲▲ FIELD 3 ▲▲▲
    //                   Your question path/name as it should appear in the LRS

    // 4. Potential answers
    var possibleAnswers = [
        "Ship the code as is.",
        "Ask Bianca to review the code after launch — you can always push out an update.",
        "Review the AI-generated code before shipping it.",
       
    ];
    //                                                  ▲▲▲ FIELD 4 ▲▲▲
    //      Replace with the FULL TEXT of all answer options for this question.
    //      Keep the array format and one answer per line.

    // 5. Correct answer
    var correctAnswer = "Review the AI-generated code before shipping it.";
    //                                                  ▲▲▲ FIELD 5 ▲▲▲
    //      Replace with the FULL TEXT of the correct answer.
