  // in-memory accumulator below. Persist keeps a copy somewhere that survives
  // the reload: opener window (the launch shell) -> sessionStorage ->
  // localStorage -> memory. Mirrors the xAPI bridge so both scripts share one
  // persistence model. This is the primary fix; suspend_data is secondary.
